ngs will continue with the  Guardians after this film is not yet  known Hollywood insiders however agree  that no one from the current cast will  be available for another Guardians of  the Galaxy movie that's why it's all the  more important for every fan to Rush the  movie theater starting May 5th 2023  because that's the day the movie  premieres  Spider-Man into the spider-verse was  probably the most successful superhero  movie made by Sony in 2018. Not only was  it very well received by critics and  fans it was also showered with countless  Awards including an Oscar for best  animated film while Miles Morales had to  Bid Farewell to his Spider-Man friends  at the end of the first part in this new  installment he is pulled into the  spider-verse and must come to the rescue  of his friends in various Dimensions at  the same time not every version of  Spider-Man looks to be a friend as we  saw in the latest trailer besides we  think every fan is dying to see what  will happen next with him and  spider-gwen as the two have already  gotten a little closer in the first part  the movie will be released on June 2nd  and is a must-see for anyone who has  watched more than enough of the MCU and  dceu  she is considered the Superman Paradox  in the MCU and is nevertheless more than  popular among fans yet we have only been  able to see her in two films however  that will change in 2023 the talk is of  course of Carol Danvers AKA Captain  Marvel she returns to Cinemas in her  second Standalone film Captain Marvel 2  The Marvels well she won't be all alone  for she'll be assisted by Ms Marvel and  Monica Rambo Ms Marvel whose real name  is Kamala Khan made her first appearance  in the MCU with her series of the same  name in the summer of 2022 and as for  Monica we already know her from One  Division both of them got super powers  and in the post-credits scene of Ms  Marvel we could already see Carol as  well who exactly would be the bad guy in  the movie is not yet known but we think  it won't be too long before we get to  see the first images or even a trailer  for the movie it is scheduled for  release in the second half of the year  starting July 28th assuming nothing  changes before that  not only the MCU and dce are expanding  in the New Year the Sony Universe around  Venom is also getting a new anti-hero  this is Craven the hunter as the name  suggests Craven is a big game hunter who  loves to hunt down powerful and big  trophies thus over time it happens that  he also goes on the hunt for superheroes  his favorite trophy that he would like  to have would be Spider-Man Craven's  real name is Sergey cravenov and in the  comics he is the half-brother of the  chameleon also known as Dimitri  smardiakov Craven the hunter is played  by Aaron Taylor-Johnson he should  already be known to any Marvel fan as  one to maximoff's brother Quicksilver  whether we'll come to a clash with Venom  or morbius in the movie is not yet known  however signs that Sony is planning to  put a Sinister Six movie into production  sooner rather than later are becoming  stronger as a result of the film Craven  is the last super villain still missing  for the union of super villains also  involved will be Calypso and the  Foreigner thus there won't be a lack of  baddies the movie is expected to be  released in theaters on October 6 2022  and should there be any changes to of  the date you'll be sure to find it in  our weekly news  we do have to wait for a long time but  in about a year Jason Momoa will return  to his starring role as Aquaman the  first part was considered one of the  most successful DC EU movies ever and  therefore many fans are eagerly awaiting  the sequel the movie will see The Return  of Black Manta who did survive the last  fight with Aquaman orm better known as  Ocean Master will also be back to give  Arthur Curry a hard time also likely to  be back is Amber Heard there were many  questions surrounding her role in the  film after she got 